$report=@('# WHAT LIES BTWN — STAGE 03D-1 STRICT CONTRACT REMEDIATION','','Date: 2026-10-13; timezone: Europe/Bucharest. Authority: exclusively validators, typing, static contracts, directly affected bindings, isolated tests and reports.','', '## A. STAGE03D1_STATUS = PASS','','S03C-09 and S03C-10 are closed for the prepared POC-0 static contracts. This PASS is not authorization or readiness for G4/G5. All execution gates remain closed.','', ('Final regression matrix: '+$results.Count+' rows, including '+$summary.executed_static_checks+' executed static checks, all PASS; zero FAIL. The other 32 rows retain Stage03C assessments: 24 NOT_IMPLEMENTED, 5 NOT_TESTED, 3 BLOCKED. These are not newly verified operational controls.'),'', '## B. EXACT_CHANGESET','','Exactly four preexisting files changed. No policy schema or package was added. The policy contract is local, explicit PowerShell data and type assertions with no reference-resolution/network dependency.','', '| File under Production OS root | Bytes before / after | SHA-256 before | SHA-256 after | Justification |','| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |')
