foreach($entry in $closure){$report+='| '+$entry.id+' | '+$entry.status+' | '+$entry.actual.Replace('|','\|')+' |'}
$report+=@('', 'All four corresponding full-validator graph cases (COMPOSITE-STRING-WIDTH, COMPOSITE-ARRAY-WIDTH, COMPOSITE-STRING-BATCH and COMPOSITE-STRING-LINK) also reject. Their fixtures have correctly rebound hashes, so rejection is from strict contracts rather than stale fingerprints. JSON root-array variants also reject both in components and full-validator copies.','', '## D. REGRESSION_TEST_MATRIX','', 'Authoritative complete expectation/actual/status/evidence/fixture matrix: tests\stage03d1\evidence\run2\REGRESSION_TEST_MATRIX.md; data: run2\test-results.json. Seven-case closure: run2\seven-distinct-closure.json. The Stage03C coverage map identifies which prior rows were rerun and which are preserved historical evidence; no claim that all 218 old inventory/approval/QC checks were newly executed.','', ('All 15 original Stage03C composite variants were replayed, expanded to '+$adaptations.Count+' full-validator fixture cases. Test-WlbManifest.ps1 is byte-identical to the current validator in every composite copy; only fixture-root literals in helper/data and fixture hashes are adjusted, then controlled malformed values/bytes are introduced. No validator predicate is weakened for tests.'),'', 'Coverage includes all graph scalar fields and link/container types; each mandatory graph key and extra properties; each mandatory policy key at every nested object, extra properties, boolean/numeric/string/string-array/null/container alternatives; preserved JSON/schema negatives; unknown/model/custom/provider/network/shell/sampler types and extra nodes; destinations/links; path traversal/outside/UNC/ADS/collisions; enabled policy and invalid preparation state; graph/core/policy/runtime hash divergence; cap drift; missing lock inventory entry. No graph node or live launcher executes.','', 'Evidence incidents are retained: first run saved its complete results before a case-insensitive variable collision in closure aggregation. Root-array probes then demonstrated a real static helper type defect and justified a fresh complete regression run after correction. Run2 raw summary grouping lost dictionary properties; FINAL_SUMMARY.json computes authoritative counts from recorded result rows. The test harness has the grouping correction for future runs. No failed evidence was deleted, overwritten or represented as runtime success.','', '## E. ORIGINAL_BASELINE_PRESERVATION','', 'Before editing, all 13 source artifacts matched the final Stage03C hashes. Exact byte copies of all 13 are preserved under tests\stage03d1\baseline and verified against the pre-edit inventory. The before and final original-root StaticReview both pass as preparation with executable=false, approval=ABSENT and submission=NOT_PERFORMED.','', ('Of '+$before.Count+' preexisting files, '+$summary.preserved_existing_files+' retain bytes/hash and UTC last-write time; only the four authorized files differ. All '+$stage03cPreserved.Count+' historical Stage03C files/reports are unchanged. Of the original 13 current files, nine are byte-identical and four have authorized changes; it would be incorrect to claim all 13 current files unchanged.'),'', 'The canonical graph remains EmptyImage -> SaveImage, 640x360, batch 1, color 0x336699, one expected RGB PNG, no models/source inputs/sampling/providers/automatic retries. The workflow, executor-policy.json, shot-manifest schema, launcher, QC checker, Bible, README, future contract and original prep receipt are byte-preserved. The unchanged launcher ends with its unconditional G4/G5 refusal; ExecutionEligibility still refuses. No real approvals/jobs/approved-workflow/runtime namespace exists.','', '## F. REMAINING_G4_BLOCKERS','', '- S03C-01 / 07: issuer/code trust, inherited writable ACLs and OS/filesystem/egress boundary decision remain unresolved; no host hardening or approval authenticity implementation.','- S03C-02 / 04: no live trusted RAM/commit/private/VRAM telemetry, freshness, preflight, exclusive owned process/engine, foreign GPU-workload check, startup timer, watchdog or aggregate log/output enforcement.','- S03C-03 / 06: no executable snapshot/dependency identity/import validation, process-local cache isolation or path/byte TOCTOU/use-time protection and atomic namespace creation implementation.','- S03C-13: owner identity, CPU policy and monitor cadence/freshness remain UNKNOWN. Existing resource limits remain exactly unchanged; no runtime measurement or fit claim.','- Stage03D-2, any G2/G3 preparation, and G4 startup each require separate human authorization. No startup implementation was added here.','', '## G. REMAINING_G5_BLOCKERS','', '- All relevant G4 prerequisites remain.','- S03C-01 / 05: no authenticated operator-issued approval or durable atomic one-use consumption/replay protection.','- S03C-08: no job submission adapter, persistent ownership/deduplication ledger, ambiguous-timeout reconciliation, recovery, authorized owned cancellation or transport retry controls.','- S03C-12: no execution-eligibility lifecycle/promotion contract or approved workflow; DRAFT is not executable.','- S03C-11: no full PNG integrity/decode/every-pixel color QC or authentic device/resource/completion evidence and human acceptance path; QC accepted=false remains unchanged.','- General input/model hashing and character/media capabilities remain deferred; no Alpha Gen or MCP work performed.','', '## H. NO_OUT_OF_SCOPE_MUTATION_ATTESTATION','', 'Directed modifications: the four listed source/binding files only. Directed creations: own Stage03D1 fixtures, exact baseline copies, test/finalization programs, evidence and this report, all inside Production OS. CREATED_FILES.csv enumerates every created absolute path and raw hash (self-referential inventory/attestation metadata excluded). COMMANDS.md / .json list operations and saved scripts preserve nested commands. all-existing-after-comparison.json supports scope preservation.','', 'No changes to MIRAE, PULSE, LTX Desktop, production ComfyUI or any 